Ana Cláudia Viero and Diogo Rodrigues Andrade da Silva, as credited. Geodiversidade do estado do Rio Grande do Sul. CPRM, Porto Alegre, 2010, 212 pages. Programa Geologia do Brasil, Levantamento da Geodiversidade. Português. [Official book, citation, and PDF](https://rigeo.sgb.gov.br/handle/doc/16774).

Read the whole regional book, then focus on a selected area's geological setting, materials, landscapes/water, constraints, and resource relationships. Pair it with the actual associated map edition and legend, preserving scale and date. A state-scale interpretation cannot establish every outcrop, subsurface condition, or current parcel-level requirement.

The institutional record identifies open access and supplies the PDF. Preserve actual edition/component notices before redistribution or adaptation. The public catalogue and citation were inspected; its large 133.68 MB PDF was not represented as fully parsed. Metadata/access checked on 29 October 2026. This is an authorized external regional reference; no map, book, or GIS collection is bundled.

